Great, thus a I see it:

1) Become root
2) type "make uninstall" from the bash shell within the build directory.
3) delete the entire folder created by the tar.gz file initially.

That should remove all the settings created over the entire system.  Deleting the rkward directory will delete the actual program files. 

Thanks for your help! 

